 "name": "Schools",
 "description": "<strong>A. SUMMARY</strong>\nThis dataset is a list of all schools in San Francisco from the California Department of Education. The dataset contains additional information such as type of school and location.\n\n<strong>B. HOW THE DATASET IS CREATED</strong>\nThis dataset was downloaded from the California Department of Education website (https://www.cde.ca.gov/). It only includes schools in San Francisco that are Open as of February 2026.\n\n<strong>C. UPDATE PROCESS</strong>\nThis dataset will update on an as-needed basis.\n\n<strong>D. HOW TO USE THIS DATASET</strong>\nThis dataset can be used to analyze the quantity and type of schools in San Francisco.\n\n<strong>E. RELATED DATASETS</strong>\n- <u><a href=\"https://data.sfgov.org/Geographic-Locations-and-Boundaries/SFUSD-School-Attendance-Areas-2024-2025-/e6tr-sxwg/about_data\">SFUSD School Attendance Areas (2024-2025)</a></u>",
